            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mayura"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is really good! My family prefers this sauce to be sweet and sour, rather than spicy, so I left out the chiles and green onion just cause we don't like green onion. But some minced red onion made for a nice floating \"topping\" on the sauce. It was yummy just hours after being made, but will let it sit and see how it mellows out :)",
